"This is a simple test from WP EasyCart to make sure your email setup is "
"correct. If you receive this your account type emails should be working "
"properly!"
msgstr ""
"Dies ist ein einfacher Test von WP EasyCart, um sicherzustellen, dass Ihre E-"
