#, php-format
msgid ""
"Stripe's standard look. The night, flat and unstyled looks come with %s."
msgstr ""
"Das Standarddesign von Stripe. Die Designs „Nacht“, „Flach“ und „Ohne Stil“ "
"sind in %s enthalten."

#. translators: %s: plan name, Pro or Premium ( Pro/Premium when no license is known ).
#: admin/template/settings/payments/stripe_connect.php:535
